<rml>
<head>
    <title>Lemon RmlUi Spike</title>
    <style>
        body {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            background: #1a1c22;
            font-family: Hiragino Sans GB;
            color: #e8e8e8;
        }
        .panel {
            width: 480px; margin-top: 120px;
            padding: 32px;
            background: #262a33;
            border: 2px #4a90d9;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 28px; color: #7fd17f;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        p { font-size: 16px; color: #b8bcc4; }
        label { display: block; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #8a94a6; }
        input {
            display: block; width: 320px; margin-top: 6px;
            padding: 8px 10px;
            background: #1b1e26; color: #e8e8e8;
            border: 2px #4a90d9; border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 16px;
            caret-color: #7fd17f;
        }
        input:focus { border-color: #7fd17f; }
        button {
            display: block; width: 200px; margin-top: 24px;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #4a90d9; color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 16px; text-align: center;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        button:hover { background: #6aaee9; }
        button:active { background: #3a7ac0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="panel">
        <h1>柠檬引擎 · RmlUi Spike</h1>
        <p>官方 SDL3 + Vulkan 后端整体接入验证。</p>
        <p>点击下方按钮，终端应打印 CLICK 日志（事件判据）。</p>
        <label for="name">角色起名（文本输入判据：中文零乱码 / 候选窗贴光标 / 事件不串）</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" maxlength="12" />
        <button id="start">开始游戏</button>
        <button id="quit">退出演示</button>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
